  "description": "A free, offline-capable multi-stopwatch application for timing multiple events simultaneously. Built for track enthusiasts, and anyone else who needs professional-grade timing tools without the professional price tag. Features group management, split tracking, analytics, and works reliably even without internet connection. Privacy-focused with local-first architecture: no accounts, no data collection, everything stays on your device.",
